w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c70295934c9c96a7END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-eb0ff70a7364dd52END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_NoteForThulda</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_NoteForThulda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_NoteForThulda\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3f01ca40-0430-456f-92dd-ffc7c85793a6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3f01ca40-0430-456f-92dd-ffc7c85793a6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3f01ca40-0430-456f-92dd-ffc7c85793a6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Found in a Pile of Sacks under the tent near <a href=\"/wiki/Thuldra_Thuldrin\" title=\"Thuldra Thuldrin\">Thuldra Thuldrin</a> in the Refugee Camp in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Thulda,\n</p><p><br>\nThe donation of cooking utensils comes from an apprentice in Brampton. He says he could get you more, but not unless you get someone through the gate. You need to find a way to show up!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063637\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1480/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23773/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5919/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935603/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.203      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.203      1 -total\n 59.77%   24.030      6 Template:Icon_text\n 54.35%   21.848     15 Template:Trim\n 38.16%   15.343      1 Template:PageSeo\n 37.76%   15.180      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.19%   10.128      2 Template:Icon_link\n 24.11%    9.694      1 Template:CharLink\n 22.41%    9.009      2 Template:Uid\n 21.41%    8.609      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46974-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715063637 and revision id 237487. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}